<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Testing Siri&#8217;s Enhanced Dictation</h3>



<p>Video · June 15 · All Labs Members</p>



<p>Apple says Siri&#8217;s enhanced dictation sets a new bar this year. I put it on an M5 iPad under the best possible conditions, ran it against a Wendell Berry poem and some free-form thinking, then handed the same tests to Wispr Flow to see how close Apple actually got.</p>



